  "summary": "Malicious code in @artistanbul/mta-frontend-footer (npm)",
  "details": "@artistanbul/mta-frontend-footer is a combosquat of the official Open edX frontend footer component (@edx/frontend-component-footer): the same React footer source tree republished under the @artistanbul scope. The package ships the cloned component code with no install hooks or network behavior in this version, but impersonates a well-known legitimate package name to be picked up as a dependency. Verify the package name/scope against the official @edx/frontend-component-footer before installing.",
